WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:04.930
Speaker 1: Hey, I want to call your attention
to something maybe you forgot about.

00:00:04.930 --> 00:00:10.680
Does everybody remember when a few months
ago the corporate media decided that now we

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:16.010
have to talk about the lab leak theory of
covid and we all have to say, hey, could it

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:20.020
have been made in a Chinese laboratory as
a bioweapon?

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:22.990
Could it accidentally have leaked from the
lab?

00:00:22.990 --> 00:00:30.099
And of course, some of us like me had all
along been saying the exact same thing, investigate

00:00:30.099 --> 00:00:31.099
everything.

00:00:31.099 --> 00:00:36.079
Why would we, without investigating, say something
is true or isn't true?

00:00:36.079 --> 00:00:39.210
Let's let's investigate the origins of covid.

00:00:39.210 --> 00:00:45.199
But until we have evidence that it came from
a lab or was deliberately made and released

00:00:45.199 --> 00:00:49.790
as a bioweapon, until we have evidence for
that, it would be irresponsible to suggest

00:00:49.790 --> 00:00:50.790
that that is likely.

00:00:50.790 --> 00:00:54.360
And that's what I said in twenty twenty and
that's what I said in early twenty, twenty

00:00:54.360 --> 00:00:55.360
one.

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:56.969
And it's what I said a few months ago when
the story was raging.

00:00:56.969 --> 00:01:01.691
But for some reason a few months ago, the
story was everywhere in the media and it was

00:01:01.691 --> 00:01:08.080
framed as why are some like Dr. Foushee and
the Left, whoever?

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:15.960
Why are people covering up and preventing
an investigation into the lab leak theory?

00:01:15.960 --> 00:01:22.670
Now, the reality was just about everybody
was saying, sure, investigated.

00:01:22.670 --> 00:01:28.270
Look into it, but we just don't have evidence
right now that that's actually what took place.

00:01:28.270 --> 00:01:34.400
But the cover up hypothesis is prototypical
of how you generate more media interest.

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:40.520
You not only float an idea, but you claim
that the idea is being suppressed, that the

00:01:40.520 --> 00:01:42.380
idea is being covered up.

00:01:42.380 --> 00:01:46.520
And this actually worked because a couple
of months ago, members of the media actually

00:01:46.520 --> 00:01:50.220
started asking Joe Biden and Biden administration
officials about it.

00:01:50.220 --> 00:01:52.950
They would ask Jen Psaki in the press briefing
room.

00:01:52.950 --> 00:01:57.300
Jen, does the Biden administration oppose
investigating what the origins?

00:01:57.300 --> 00:01:59.290
No, no, it doesn't oppose.

00:01:59.290 --> 00:02:00.600
We're fine with an investigation.

00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:06.420
I think it was Peter Steve Doocy, Peter Doocy,
who asked Joe Biden about it, and Joe Biden

00:02:06.420 --> 00:02:08.960
said investigate, go ahead and investigate.

00:02:08.960 --> 00:02:12.800
And just about everybody was saying, we don't
rule out anything.

00:02:12.800 --> 00:02:14.500
Let's find out.

00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:16.820
But we don't yet have evidence that that's
the case.

00:02:16.820 --> 00:02:21.370
Now, here's the really important part in understanding
these media cycles.

00:02:21.370 --> 00:02:25.150
When this bubbled up a couple of months ago
and Joe Biden was asked about it and so was

00:02:25.150 --> 00:02:31.700
Jen Psaki, there was no new evidence at that
time that would make us say this now looks

00:02:31.700 --> 00:02:33.250
much more likely.

00:02:33.250 --> 00:02:35.090
So let's ask about it.

00:02:35.090 --> 00:02:40.110
It came in and then it suddenly went away
and it became a nonstory.

00:02:40.110 --> 00:02:41.830
It may come back again.

00:02:41.830 --> 00:02:47.000
At no point was there really any reason to
think that covid was a bioweapon that came

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:48.320
from a lab.

00:02:48.320 --> 00:02:55.100
It's just the perfect prototypical example
of how something becomes a story in the media.

00:02:55.100 --> 00:03:00.620
And then just as quickly the story goes away
and we don't even really understand why.

00:03:00.620 --> 00:03:02.350
And this was the case all along.

00:03:02.350 --> 00:03:06.880
And then very quietly, a few days ago, we
got a new report published written about in

00:03:06.880 --> 00:03:13.520
Nature which explains that, quote, The intelligence
investigation is inconclusive on virus's origins,

00:03:13.520 --> 00:03:20.670
but finds it wasn't weaponized and it is unlikely
to have been engineered, according to the

00:03:20.670 --> 00:03:25.890
declassified key takeaways issued by the Office
of the Director of National Intelligence and

00:03:25.890 --> 00:03:27.130
the intelligence community.

00:03:27.130 --> 00:03:31.760
More broadly, it's been assessed that the
covid virus likely first appeared in Wuhan

00:03:31.760 --> 00:03:37.680
no later than November of twenty nineteen,
emerged without the knowledge of Chinese authorities

00:03:37.680 --> 00:03:39.630
and was not developed as a bioweapon.

00:03:39.630 --> 00:03:46.890
Most agencies also agreed, though with low
confidence, that it was probably not genetically

00:03:46.890 --> 00:03:52.290
engineered, although to an agency's believe
we don't yet have enough evidence to say for

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:53.290
sure.

00:03:53.290 --> 00:03:57.459
So when you read it, if you read it with the
conspiratorial mind, you say this is part

00:03:57.459 --> 00:03:58.720
of the cover up.

00:03:58.720 --> 00:04:03.680
There's sort of not closing the door completely
to the possibility.

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:10.110
But but if you actually look at it for what
it is, understand that for a very long time

00:04:10.110 --> 00:04:15.590
there was fear, uncertainty and doubt generated
around the idea that the true origins were

00:04:15.590 --> 00:04:16.590
being covered up.

00:04:16.590 --> 00:04:23.960
The truth is, we never had evidence to believe
that this was bioengineered or leaked from

00:04:23.960 --> 00:04:26.280
a lab or released as a bioweapon.

00:04:26.280 --> 00:04:27.550
We didn't have evidence for that.

00:04:27.550 --> 00:04:28.720
We couldn't rule it out.

00:04:28.720 --> 00:04:33.130
Sometimes in science, you can't rule things
out, but you don't have evidence for them

00:04:33.130 --> 00:04:39.669
that allowed for people to weaponize the hypothesis,
to attack others, to claim that there were

00:04:39.669 --> 00:04:43.730
bad liberal people lying and covering this
up.

00:04:43.730 --> 00:04:48.889
And I am still open to the possibility that
this was being studied and it leaked or whatever.

00:04:48.889 --> 00:04:54.370
I don't think we should put any kind of limitation
on studying it, but we don't have evidence

00:04:54.370 --> 00:04:55.370
for it.

00:04:55.370 --> 00:04:59.530
And it's very similar to the use of the migrant
caravanned stories or stories of Middle Eastern

00:04:59.530 --> 00:05:02.100
terrorists coming through the US Mexico border.

00:05:02.100 --> 00:05:03.710
All these things are physically possible.

00:05:03.710 --> 00:05:08.470
They're theoretically possible someone could
go from the Middle East to Guatemala and then

00:05:08.470 --> 00:05:11.730
come to Mexico and physically cross the US
Mexico border.

00:05:11.730 --> 00:05:14.710
We don't actually have evidence that that's
going on.

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:19.580
And there's this churn of unverifiable, rage
inducing propaganda.

00:05:19.580 --> 00:05:25.520
There are legitimate questions about the exact
chemistry of the Wuhan's strains and about

00:05:25.520 --> 00:05:27.860
events at the Wuhan lab.

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:30.770
It's been discussed in reputable media.

00:05:30.770 --> 00:05:32.310
Let's investigate it.

00:05:32.310 --> 00:05:38.480
There is no reason right now to think that
it came from a lab just like before.

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:42.949
So how much are we going to sort of repeat
the same story absent that evidence?

00:05:42.949 --> 00:05:43.949
Now, one other thing.

00:05:43.949 --> 00:05:45.710
There's another important thing.

00:05:45.710 --> 00:05:53.340
When people say this is being discussed everywhere
online, like how is this not a serious story?

00:05:53.340 --> 00:05:59.980
The discussion online is biased towards controversy
and conspiracy.

00:05:59.980 --> 00:06:02.400
You just have to understand that.

00:06:02.400 --> 00:06:08.010
And that's important when we talk about the
baseline of a lot of these discussions.

00:06:08.010 --> 00:06:12.620
But the perfect example, the story came two
months ago and then it went.

00:06:12.620 --> 00:06:16.400
And we still don't have more evidence that
any of those hypotheses are true

